summary: Recognize the DGX Station GB300 GPU
description: |
  Verify that the installed NVIDIA hardware database includes PCI device
  10de:31c3 with the kernelopen feature, which radii requires to recognize
  the DGX Station GB300 GPU. The entry for 10de:31c2 does not cover this
  device. This checks the packaged data without requiring GPU hardware.
link:
  - verifies: https://issues.redhat.com/browse/RHEL-211921
tag:
  - hwdata-nv
tier: 1
duration: 1m
require:
  - jq
